C++ vs Nginx for real-time analytics

We're running C++ 15.9.5 in one of our Backend services and started seeing `deadlock detected` under high concurrency while load testing the service. It seems worse under peak traffic. Here's a sample from the logs:

```
[2026-09-08 06:35:58] ERROR C++ - deadlock detected in build step (req_id=663639)
