body:
This came up in code review a few times, so here's the version we settled on.

```java
ListNode reverseList(ListNode head) {
    ListNode prev = null;
    while (head != null) {
        ListNode next = head.next;
        head.next = prev;
        prev = head;
        head = next;
    }
    return prev;
}
```

content:
Reverse a linked list - Java implementation notes

This came up in code review a few times, so here's the version we settled on.

```java
ListNode reverseList(ListNode head) {
    ListNode prev = null;
    while (head != null) {
        ListNode next = head.next;
        head.next = prev;
        prev = head;
        head = next;
    }
    return prev;
}
```

--- Accepted Answer ---
Note this isn't thread-safe as written — wrap it if you need concurrent access.

