body:
Sharing our internal standard for this pattern so new hires have something to copy from.

```python
def dfs(graph, node, visited=None):
    if visited is None:
        visited = set()
    visited.add(node)
    for neighbor in graph[node]:
        if neighbor not in visited:
            dfs(graph, neighbor, visited)
    return visited
```

Wanted to save a clean reference version of this for the team wiki.

```java
static void mergeSort(int[] arr, int l, int r) {
    if (l >= r) return;
    int m = (l + r) / 2;
    mergeSort(arr, l, m);
    mergeSort(arr, m + 1, r);
    merge(arr, l, m, r);
}
```

